   "text": "Overseas on a great tour"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.28,
   "end": 59.44,
   "text": "Uh, maybe I'm just dreamin'"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.44,
   "end": 62.4,
   "text": "It beats bein' with demons or niggas that's schemin'"
  },
  {
   "start": 62.4,
   "end": 64.24,
   "text": "At least I'm thinkin' of an achievement"
  },
  {
